      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Calhoun%2C_Louisiana"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Because it is unincorporated, Calhoun is governed by Ouachita Parish’s Police Jury rather than a local city council.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
