      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Calhoun%2C_Louisiana"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The town lies in a rural setting of hills and woodlands along the old U.S. transcontinental route.",
